{"about":"Every edit that removes a line break the reading view shows, in every corpus document: `join` is ⌫ at the start of a line (or ⌦ at the end of the one above), `joinTyping` is typing over the line break, `deleteLine` is deleting the whole line it ends. Replace the `rendered` range of the document's rendered text with `with`; the Markdown that edit replaces is the `source` range of the document.","caseCount":273,"documents":[{"id":"empty","rendered":"","text":""},{"id":"plain","rendered":"One plain paragraph with no markup at all.\n","text":"One plain paragraph with no markup at all.\n"},{"id":"headings","rendered":"Title\nBody under the title.\n\nSubheading\nThird level\n####### Seven hashes is not a heading\nThree spaces still is\n#NoSpace is not a heading","text":"# Title\nBody under the title.\n\n## Subheading\n### Third level\n####### Seven hashes is not a heading\n   # Three spaces still is\n#NoSpace is not a heading"},{"id":"emphasis","rendered":"Some bold and italic and both.\nsnake_case_stays_plain but this is italic.\nAstrikethrough, and underscored bold.\nintrawordemphasis with asterisks.","text":"Some **bold** and *italic* and ***both***.\nsnake_case_stays_plain but _this is italic_.\nA~~strike~~through, and __underscored bold__.\nintra*word*emphasis with asterisks."},{"id":"code","rendered":"Inline code and a `tick` inside and padded.\n\nlet x = 1\n\nTrailing text.","text":"Inline `code` and ``a `tick` inside`` and ` padded `.\n\n```swift\nlet x = 1\n```\n\nTrailing text."},{"id":"lists","rendered":"• first\n• second\n• nested\n• star bullet\n• plus bullet\n\n1. one\n2. two\n7. seven starts here","text":"- first\n- second\n  - nested\n* star bullet\n+ plus bullet\n\n1. one\n2. two\n7. seven starts here"},{"id":"tasks","rendered":"☐ unchecked\n☑ checked\n☑ capital\n• [] not a task","text":"- [ ] unchecked\n- [x] checked\n- [X] capital\n- [] not a task"},{"id":"quotes","rendered":"quoted line\nsecond quoted line\nlazy continuation\n> nested quote\n